NOTE ON PROVENANCE. Every artifact in this dataset is synthetic and was
generated for this benchmark. It contains no real institution's source code,
no real business documents, and no personal or customer data. All companies,
people, accounts, products, and document numbers appearing in it are invented.

NOTE FOR MODEL TRAINERS. This dataset is published as an evaluation artifact.
Including it in pre-training or fine-tuning corpora destroys its value as a
contamination-free benchmark. Please exclude it.
